# The batch's decision waits for every entry to be staged, so a diverted
# entry strands the rest of its batch.
MODULE: EveryEntryResolvedDiversionStrandsBatch
TARGET: EveryEntryResolved
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a diverted entry is counted as missing from its batch
PERTURBS: Decide

--- FIND
    /\ \A e \in AtomicEntries : st[e] # "Pending"
    /\ decided' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
    /\ \A e \in AtomicEntries : st[e] = "Staged"
    /\ decided' = TRUE
--- END
